        <description><![CDATA[
                    <h3>What's New</h3>
                    <ul>
  <li>You can now choose to copy markdown or plain text</li>
  <li>Send the AI custom instructions in the AI Preferences Panel</li>
  <li>We now show an alert if we have issues uploading a new note and let you retry</li>
  <li>Removed extra space at the top and bottom of list and editor that was cutting off text</li>
  <li>New colors and background style for the entire app</li>
                    </ul>
                ]]></description>
