            <description><![CDATA[
                    <h3>What's New</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li>You can now choose to include audio or notes only in a shared note link</li>
                        <li>The loading screen got a little upgrade</li>
                        <li>Native share sheet added in share button</li>
                        <li>Fixed custom OpenAI key not saving</li>
                        <li>Custom keyboard shortcuts added for canceling recording, formatting buttons, and opening settings</li>
                    </ul>
